      "source": "dom",
      "confidence": "high",
      "text": "Furniture that outlives its owner"
    },
    {
      "key": "main/paragraph/7aa5e800b9ab",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "region": "main",
      "source": "dom",
      "confidence": "high",
      "text": "We make chairs, tables and cabinets by hand, in oak, walnut and Portuguese cork."
    },
    {
      "key": "main/heading/646c722c7e76",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "region": "main",
      "source": "dom",
      "confidence": "high",
      "text": "The studio"
    },
    {
      "key": "main/paragraph/df3645eb1946",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "region": "main",
      "source": "dom",
      "confidence": "high",
      "text": "Aurelia Atelier was founded in 1974 by Ines Aurelia in a converted bakery in Alcantara. The workshop has occupied the same three rooms ever since."
    },
    {
      "key": "main/paragraph/ef8046119aeb",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "region": "main",
      "source": "dom",
      "confidence": "high",
      "text": "Eleven people work here. Six are cabinetmakers, two are finishers, and three keep everything else moving."
    },
    {
      "key": "main/paragraph/b18164797d11",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "region": "main",
      "source": "dom",
      "confidence": "high",
      "text": "Every piece is made to order. A dining table takes nine weeks; a cabinet with hand-cut dovetails takes fourteen."
    },
    {
      "key": "main/paragraph/b7b600004efa",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "region": "main",
      "source": "dom",
      "confidence": "high",
      "text": "We do not use veneer over particle board, and we do not stain wood to imitate a species it is not."
    },
    {
      "key": "main/heading/fd10a146e962",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "region": "main",
      "source": "dom",
      "confidence": "high",
